sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant L as Lead / 引擎
  participant B as Bridge 关闭路径
  participant G as 所有权登记 registry
  participant A as adapter + goal runtime
  participant D as Codex daemon
  participant K as 终态收尸账本
  L->>B: terminate / closeRunner / 退役
  B->>G: requestStop(exec, reason)
  G->>A: onStopRequested
  A->>A: runtime.stop()，stopped=true
  A->>D: SIGTERM → 等退出 → 必要时 SIGKILL
  D--xA: socket 断开
  Note over A: 重启闸门：已请停 → 拒绝复活
  A->>G: drain 完成后 release lease
  G-->>B: stopped
  B->>D: reap 进程组（兜底，已退出则 absent）
  B->>K: 探测一次，记 pending_confirm
  Note over K: 下一轮巡检再测一次 + token 未涨 → closed
